# Raw per-rep JSON/PNG/log output is gitignored by default (BENCHMARK_PLAN.md
# §7: "results/ gitignored raw output, committed summaries"). When a run's
# numbers are ready to publish, force-add that specific results/<ts>/
# directory (git add -f) so RESULTS.md's evidence trail resolves —
# ground rule: "every number in RESULTS.md traces to a JSON file in the
# same commit."
results/
.bin/
__pycache__/
